---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import CoreCompetencies from '../components/CoreCompetencies.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Ariya Sarrafzadeh"
  description="Senior Product Manager & Technical Systems Architect leading high-throughput payment infrastructure, SMS switches, fraud forensics, and data pipelines."
>
  <!-- Bio Header Section -->
  <section class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-12 text-center font-sans">
    <div class="relative inline-block mx-auto mb-6">
      <div class="absolute -inset-8 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,rgba(6,182,212,0.14),transparent_50%)] blur-2xl z-0"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 w-28 h-28 rounded-2xl p-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}photos/ariya.jpg`}
          alt="Ariya Sarrafzadeh"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3 text-[#f8fafc]">Ariya Sarrafzadeh</h1>
    
    <!-- Sub-head positioning statement -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#e2c974] font-mono">
        Senior Product Manager &amp; Technical Systems Architect
      </span>
    </div>

    <p class="text-[#94a3b8] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      15+ years designing, building, and operating high-availability financial switches,
      telecom aggregators, and forensic fraud platforms. The work is hands-on systems architecture and product leadership:
      Spring Cloud Gateway reactive routing, UAA stateless JWT delegation, Switch-PSP dynamic routing across 4 national PSPs (SEP, PEC, BPM, PEP),
      two-phase balance reservations in Double-Entry ACID Ledgers, PCI-DSS card vault encryption, and 24h early merchant settlements.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Cornerstone Section: The 0-to-Scale Story -->
  <section class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 font-sans">
    <div class="bg-[#141210]/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-white/5 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4 mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#06b6d4]"></span>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#f8fafc]">
            The 0-to-Scale Story
          </h2>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#06b6d4] uppercase px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#06b6d4]/10 border border-[#06b6d4]/20">
          Executive Foundation
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Cornerstone Content -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-[#141210]/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-xl">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#cbd5e1] leading-relaxed">
          I joined environments hampered by fragmented legacy systems and synchronous bottlenecks. Infrastructure was failing under the weight of national traffic spikes; gateway timeouts caused financial discrepancies, and untuned fraud rules choked legitimate revenue. I systematically tore down these bottlenecks: deployed Switch-PSP for dynamic routing across 4 national payment providers, built Double-Entry ACID Ledgers with two-phase reservations (AVAILABLE to RESERVED), enforced Redis token-bucket rate limiters, isolated PCI-DSS card data vaults, and unified credit/BNPL scoring with RabbitMQ eventual consistency. We scaled from handling thousands of localized events to processing 50,000+ TPS bursts with zero financial drift.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CoreCompetencies locale="en" />
  <Timeline locale="en" />

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-center">
    <a href="#book" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d4af37] to-[#e2c974] text-[#0b1120] transition-all duration-300 active:scale-[0.98] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:brightness-110 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#d4af37]">
      Book an Architecture Review ↓
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
